      en: ["Seat of the Catholic Diocese of Ruhengeri.", "Official name: Cathédrale Notre-Dame de Fatima.", "Located in Musanze, the gateway to Volcanoes NP.", "Built in the mid-20th century.", "Important spiritual site in the Northern Province.", "Often visited by tourists en route to the gorillas.", "Blend of European and local architectural styles."]
