      en: "The M&M Plaza is a modern commercial and shopping center in the heart of Kigali. It is part of the rapid urban development that has transformed the capital's center in recent years. The multi-story building houses a variety of shops, including boutiques, electronics stores, and supermarkets, as well as offices, banks, and restaurants. It's a popular spot for locals for shopping and business meetings. The architecture is functional and modern, with a glass facade that allows for bright interiors. M&M Plaza is a good example of the growing commercial infrastructure in Kigali, reflecting the increasing prosperity and demand for modern retail spaces in the city. It is a bustling hub of daily life in the city center."
